{"id":"gewiss","lemma":"gewiss","pos":"adv","rank":1763,"glosses":["certainly, indeed"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈvɪs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/71/De-gewiss.ogg/De-gewiss.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das ist gewiss möglich.","en":"That's certainly possible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/469932","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"possible"}]},{"text":"Das ist gewiss keine gute Idee.","en":"That's certainly not a good idea.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"idea"}]},{"text":"Sie wird gewiss überrascht sein.","en":"She is certain to be surprised.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,{"g":"surprised"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Wir sind ganz gewiss nicht vollkommen.","en":"We're definitely not perfect.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"entire"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"perfect"}]},{"text":"Das scheint gewiss der Fall zu sein.","en":"That does certainly seem to be the case.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to shine","l":"scheinen"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"fall, drop"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to be"}]}]}